covery write-back race.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts: falls back to original prompt source when the deterministic floor is unavailable\",\"packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts: does not overwrite a ready row written before floor recovery persists\",\"packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts: renders assistant text, thinking, and runtime notes verbatim in record order\",\"packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts: constructs a turn with every component present when multiple derivations are not ready\"],\"modified\":[],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":426,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":27},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm exec vitest run test/turn-cascade.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"SV-03-001: recoverDerivation now has state IN ('pending', 'failed') in the write-back predicate; the new race test writes 'real worker output' before floor persistence and asserts that content survives while the floor still renders.\",\"SV-03-002: TC-3.2c, TC-3.4a, and TC-3.5a now have direct assertions in packages/lhc/test/turn-cascade.test.ts.\",\"TC-3.8d evidence: existing live-work test asserts pending row plus live work item remain, and new ready-row race test asserts worker-produced ready content survives recovery floor write-back.\",\"TC-3.7a evidence: existing recovery test asserts probeAcquired true after opening BEGIN IMMEDIATE from inside provider smoothPrompt, proving recovery provider work is outside SDK DB write completion.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Run story verifier again for Story 3.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-